  "title": "Pumpkin Coconut Muffins with Chocolate Chips",
  "description": "As the title states, this recipe makes pumpkin-flavored muffins with coconut and chocolate chips, but also uses applesauce, unrefined sugar, and whole-wheat and pastry flours.",
